{"id":"2e4fbca24b73ad4b","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space.md","title":"ZFC Prob Completed Measure Space","display":"df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space — ZFC Prob Completed Measure Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space"],"display":"df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space — ZFC Prob Completed Measure Space","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob-completed-measure-space — ZFC Prob Completed Measure Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,A,B,C,N,Z\\in V\">\\(\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,A,B,C,N,Z\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}completed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S(\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\overline{\\mathcal A}\n=\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline{\\mu},X,\\overline{\\mathcal A})\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\n\\to\\overline{\\mu}(B)=\\mu(A)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall N\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\mu}(N)=0\\to\\forall C\\subseteq N\\;(C\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}completed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S(\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\overline{\\mathcal A}\n=\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline{\\mu},X,\\overline{\\mathcal A})\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\n\\to\\overline{\\mu}(B)=\\mu(A)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall N\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\mu}(N)=0\\to\\forall C\\subseteq N\\;(C\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The completed sigma-algebra is defined modulo measurable null sets, and the extension value is tied to every measurable representative.</li>\n<li>The final clause states completeness explicitly.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu,X,A,B,C,N,Z\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob\\text{-}completed\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcProbCompletedMeasureSpace}_S(\\overline{\\mathcal A},\\overline{\\mu},\\mathcal A,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists X\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal A,X)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal A)\n\\land\\overline{\\mathcal A}\n=\\{B\\subseteq X:\\exists A,Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\overline{\\mu},X,\\overline{\\mathcal A})\n\\land\\forall B\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\Bigl(\n\\exists Z\\in\\mathcal A\\;(\\mu(Z)=0\\land((B\\setminus A)\\cup(A\\setminus B))\\subseteq Z)\n\\to\\overline{\\mu}(B)=\\mu(A)\n\\Bigr)\n\\land\\forall N\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A}\\;\n\\bigl(\\overline{\\mu}(N)=0\\to\\forall C\\subseteq N\\;(C\\in\\overline{\\mathcal A})\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1850,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc7